t contracts from HYPHA-API-SURFACE\n    37→- `api-streaming-agent`: SSE endpoint `GET /events/stream?channel=...`\n    38→- `frontend-agent`: Existing page components and `AuthContext`\n    39→- `NUTRIENTS.md`: API_CONTRACTS section for request/response shapes\n    40→\n    41→## Outputs (Deliverables)\n    42→\n    43→- `frontend/src/api/client.ts`\n    44→- `frontend/src/api/auth.ts`\n    45→- `frontend/src/api/discovery.ts`\n    46→- `frontend/src/api/applications.ts`\n    47→- `frontend/src/api/events.ts`\n    48→- `frontend/src/api/types.ts` (shared API types)\n    49→- `frontend/src/api/__tests__/client.test.ts`\n    50→- Updated: `frontend/src/pages/Overview.tsx`\n    51→- Updated: `frontend/src/pages/Pipeline.tsx`\n    52→- Updated: `frontend/src/pages/Analytics.tsx`\n    53→- Updated: `frontend/src/pages/ReviewQueue.tsx`\n    54→- Updated: `frontend/src/pages/ReviewDetail.tsx`\n    55→\n    56→## Acceptance Criteria\n    57→\n    58→- [ ] `npm run typecheck` clean — all API calls are fully typed\n    59→- [ ] Opening the frontend with backend running shows real digest data, not mocks\n    60→- [ ] Magic-link login flow works end-to-end: enter email → receive link → click → land on dashboard\n    61→- [ ] JWT is stored in `localStorage` under `talent-agent-jwt` after successful auth\n    62→- [ ] Every API request includes `Authorization: Bearer ${jwt}` header\n    63→- [ ] Clicking Approve in `ReviewDetail` fires `POST /applications/{id}/approve` and updates the row\n    64→- [ ] Clicking Reject in `ReviewDetail` opens confirmation, fires `POST /applications/{id}/reject`, updates the row\n    65→- [ ] 401 response invalidates JWT, redirects to `/login`, shows toast \"Session expired\"\n    66→- [ ] Network error (backend down) shows error toast and renders error state in affected component\n    67→- [ ] `subscribeAgentStatus('agent.status.discovery', callback)` opens EventSource, calls callback on each SSE data frame\n    68→- [ ] EventSource auto-reconnect